       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. FIBONACCI.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 LIMIT-N PIC 9(3).
       01 I PIC 9(3).
       01 FIRST-NUM PIC 9(18) VALUE 0.
       01 SECOND-NUM PIC 9(18) VALUE 1.
       01 NEXT-NUM PIC 9(18).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           DISPLAY "Enter number of terms: " WITH NO ADVANCING.
           ACCEPT LIMIT-N.
           PERFORM VARYING I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL I > LIMIT-N
               DISPLAY FIRST-NUM
               ADD FIRST-NUM TO SECOND-NUM GIVING NEXT-NUM
               MOVE SECOND-NUM TO FIRST-NUM
               MOVE NEXT-NUM TO SECOND-NUM
           END-PERFORM.
           STOP RUN.
